  <p id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father:m0002" ref="1kj_vhc_cx9">桀</persName>、 <persName id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father:m0005" ref="1kj_vhc_cx9_A">安</persName>父子與大將軍<persName id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father:m0012" ref="eug_nzm_5pu">光</persName>爭權，欲害之，詐使人為<rs id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father:m0024" type="unresolved">燕王旦</rs>上書言<persName id="c-hanshu-007-jin098-huanwen-wuchang:father:m0030" ref="eug_nzm_5pu">光</persName>罪。</p>
